WHAT IS NOT INCLUDED
============================================================

No symbol library is bundled. The widely used AAC symbol sets — PCS,
SymbolStix and Widgit — are proprietary and licensed separately. Version 0.1
uses emoji and caregiver-supplied photographs instead. If an open symbol set
is added in future it will be Mulberry (CC BY-SA) or another set whose
license permits redistribution here, and this file will say so.

